        "created_at": "2013-10-23T19:01:34.000Z",
        "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote no-group\" data-username=\"PePe QuiCoSE\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n PePe QuiCoSE:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>I did mention the one poster who says that if someone feels offended by words it's their own fault, so no personal attack intended.</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>Yes and I completely stand by that logic, even when it's at my own \"expense\".&nbsp; The \"attack\" didn't bother me at all.&nbsp; I'm sad that so many people here misunderstand me, but it's something I'm thoroughly used to and I don't get wounded by it anymore; I just withdraw to the blackness of my cavern and continue brooding upon my nonspecific hatred for the unjust world beyond.</p>",
